  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-07T16:20:33.885Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Recently CATs blender plugin added a warning if you had a lot of materials in a avatar. I think it would push the community to optimize their avatars, or at least lead people to ask questions, if the SDK upload menu did the same thing. It could work similarly to height warnings. Example “Your avatar has more than 10 materials, this avatar may not run well on lower end systems”\n\nI think actually limiting users will push users to use modified sdk’s, so please don’t actually limit the amount of materials.",
